{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world's linguistic heritage is in danger as a memory-devouring plague is spreading across the mysterious Bashires Islands, threatening to erase entire languages from existence and plunge all of humanity into oblivion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join Lemon on his adventure and face the darkness before it's too late.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master Lemon</strong> is a tribute to Andr\u00e9 Lima, a vibrant adventurer whose passion for languages and cultures knew no bounds. Set against the enchanting backdrop of Iceland, where he lived out his dream, <strong>Master Lemon</strong> celebrates his legacy and the enduring bond of friendship that transcends time and loss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070390/extras/30ab5a9796c065416c9c83049b60d35e.poster.avif?t=1755699123\" width=780 height=439 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070390/extras/30ab5a9796c065416c9c83049b60d35e.webm?t=1755699123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>The Power of Words</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a beautifully crafted pixel art world filled with unique puzzles and unforgettable characters. Each Bashir you meet is inspired by real cultures from our world, to celebrate and appreciate the things that connect us across different cultures. Use words from over 25 real-world languages to explore, solve puzzles, and change the world around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070390/extras/e2a8ddac0560a2209e42945e05922b95.poster.avif?t=1755699123\" width=780 height=439 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070390/extras/e2a8ddac0560a2209e42945e05922b95.webm?t=1755699123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>Puzzle-packed Adventure</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate through various levels that test your wit and cunning, offering a rewarding experience as you unravel the mystery of the plague.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070390/extras/d1d0163b1fbffba747eb2170997fee2a.poster.avif?t=1755699123\" width=780 height=439 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070390/extras/d1d0163b1fbffba747eb2170997fee2a.webm?t=1755699123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>Make Lemonade out of Lemons</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embrace the spirit of resilience and curiosity as you journey with Lemon. This adventure is not just about overcoming obstacles, but about celebrating life, language, and friendship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a story that honors the unbreakable bond of friendship, the love of adventure, and the universal connections we all share, all inspired by real-life connections.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3070390?t=1755699123","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070390/87c0e6c51dbfcd63692a96c933a98e102483aca5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755699123","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070390/c22ed5a84aca8e08ec8960711adcdff0d2f7fad4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755699123","capsule_imagev5":"https://