 world, to celebrate and appreciate the things that connect us across different cultures. Use words from over 25 real-world languages to explore, solve puzzles, and change the world around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070390/extras/e2a8ddac0560a2209e42945e05922b95.poster.avif?t=1755699123\" width=780 height=439 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070390/extras/e2a8ddac0560a2209e42945e05922b95.webm?t=1755699123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>Puzzle-packed Adventure</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate through various levels that test your wit and cunning, offering a rewarding experience as you unravel the mystery of the plague.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070390/extras/d1d0163b1fbffba747eb2170997fee2a.poster.avif?t=1755699123\" width=780 height=439 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070390/extras/d1d0163b1fbffba747eb2170997fee2a.webm?t=1755699123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>Make Lemonade out of Lemons</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embrace the spirit of resilience and curiosity as you journey with Lemon. This adventure is not just about overcoming obstacles, but about celebrating life, language, and friendship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a story that honors the unbreakable bond of friendship, the love of adventure, and the universal connections we all share, all inspired by real-life connections.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":